  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERNATIONAL FEDERATION OF JOURNALISTS UKRAINE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding will support journalists to continue their work in Ukraine by providing: protective equipment: helmets and flak jackets; secure and additional communication tools: secured phones, satellite phones; replacement or portable media equipment: power banks, cloud storage, etc.; medical supplies and First Aid kits; development and delivery of safety training sessions; provision of emergency hotline and up to date safety advice; cost to evacuate journalists and their families from border areas and provide them with accommodation and short-term living costs.</narrative>
  </description>
